      "content": "that makes sense. could you dive a bit deeper into the 'demographic volatility' part? specifically, how would we weigh those factors—like high immigration or certain ethnic shifts—against the crime stats to get an accurate prediction of where unrest is actually going to pop up? i want to make sure we aren't just looking at old crime data, but actually seeing where the social tensions are building up based on the changing makeup of the neighborhoods.",
